  "description": "Slot 19: t = f * 0.0625, n = rhe(t - 0.5), n + 1 when t == n + 1: an exact floor. 0, 15.99, 16, 31.99, 32, -0.1, -16 -> 0, 0, 1, 1, 2, -1, -1. Slot 18: x * 16.",
